Error [E0955]: `embed_file` can't read `embed_binary.dat` as text
  --> tests/ui/comptime_embed_not_utf8.jet:1:17
    |
  1 | comptime TEXT = embed_file("embed_binary.dat")
    |                 ^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: the file isn't valid UTF-8; `embed_file` returns a String
 Fix: embed it with `embed_bytes("path")` instead — it returns raw `[U8]`

Error [E0107]: nothing named `TEXT` exists here
  --> tests/ui/comptime_embed_not_utf8.jet:3:13
    |
  3 |     print("{TEXT}")
    |             ^^^^
 Why: a name must be declared before it's used
 Fix: declare it first: `TEXT #= ...`
